        "Content": "Front Garden:\r\n\r\n- Open front drive, cobble stone paving, off-street parking for two cars, electric car charger\r\n\r\nHall:   c. 6.43 x 3.23m\r\n\r\n- Extended hall, wide ‘L’ shaped, long hallway, herringbone wood flooring, guest W.C.\r\n\r\nDownstairs W.C:   c. 1.38 x 0.80m\r\n\r\n- Under stairs guest W.C, 2x piece suite, tiled floor\r\n\r\nSitting Room:   c. 3.62 x 3.62m\r\n\r\n- Feature sitting room to front, open fire, herringbone flooring\r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen & Dining Area:     \tc. 5.54 x 3.64m\r\n\r\n-\tExtended kitchen to rear, large open plan area, fitted units, gas hob, electric oven, comfortable seating, Velux window for extra natural light, access to garden, tiled floor\r\n\r\nLanding:     \t\t\tc. 2.81 x 1.90m\r\n\r\n-\tNeat landing, hot press, access to attic, wood flooring\r\n\r\nBedroom 1:     \t\t               c. 2.75 x 2.35m\t\t\t             (to front)\r\n\r\n-\tSingle bedroom, built in wardrobes, wood flooring\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:     \t\t\tc.3.64 x 3.20m\t\t\t              (to front)\r\n\r\n-\t Double bedroom, fitted wardrobes, double window, wood flooring\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 3:     \t\t\tc.2.93 x 3.10m\t\t               \t(to rear)\r\n\r\n-\tDouble bedroom, fitted wardrobes, double window, wood flooring\r\n\r\nBathroom:     \t\t\tc. 1.62 x 2.40m\r\n\r\n-\tLarge family bathroom, 3x piece suite, pumped shower over bath, wall tiling\r\n\r\nAttic:    \t\t\t\tc. 3.07 x 5.56m \r\n\r\n-\tSteep access by ‘boat’ style stairs, Landing area ( c. 2.31 x 1.86m), open attic, floored, Velux window\r\n\r\nBack Garden:      \t\t \tc. 8m in length\r\n\r\n-\tSouth facing, large garden shed, with electric and plumbing, low maintenance, loose gravel stone, rear access"
